{"id": "C1704E", "jp": "これで、{end}", "en": "And so,{end}"},
{"id": "C17053", "jp": "今回の光と闇による聖魔戦争は{end}", "en": "this Holy-Demon War of Light and Dark{end}"},
{"id": "C1706A", "jp": "幕を閉じることになる。{end}", "en": "comes to a close.{end}"},
{"id": "C17078", "jp": "至高神が言った言葉は{end}", "en": "The words the Supreme God spoke{end}"},
{"id": "C17089", "jp": "決して間違いではない。{end}", "en": "were by no means mistaken.{end}"},
{"id": "C17098", "jp": "聖魔戦争が{end}", "en": "Whether the Holy-Demon War{end}"},
{"id": "C170A2", "jp": "再び起こるか起こらないかは…{end}", "en": "will break out again or not...{end}"},
{"id": "C170B4", "jp": "そう…人々の心がけによるだろう。{end}", "en": "yes... depends on the hearts of people.{end}"},
{"id": "C170C8", "jp": " {end}", "en": ""},
{"id": "C170CA", "jp": "長い年月を経て{end}", "en": "Over long years, something in the heart{end}"},
{"id": "C170D6", "jp": "心の中の何かが光や闇に別れ、{end}", "en": "divides itself into Light and Dark,{end}"},
{"id": "C170EB", "jp": "お互いを認めなくなり{end}", "en": "the two refuse to accept each other,{end}"},
{"id": "C170F8", "jp": "それが大きな力となり{end}", "en": "that grows into a great power,{end}"},
{"id": "C17105", "jp": "押さえきれなくなったときに{end}", "en": "and when it can no longer be held back,{end}"},
{"id": "C17114", "jp": "過ちは、{end}", "en": "isn't that when the mistakes,{end}"},
{"id": "C1711A", "jp": "悲劇は起こるのではないだろうか?{end}", "en": "the tragedies, come to pass?{end}"},
{"id": "C1712E", "jp": " {end}", "en": ""},
{"id": "C17130", "jp": "君たちのまわりに目を向けて欲しい。{end}", "en": "I want you to look around you.{end}"},
{"id": "C17146", "jp": "君たちが少しでも、ほんの少しでも、{end}", "en": "If you, even a little, just a little,{end}"},
{"id": "C1715B", "jp": "全てを包み込む広い心。{end}", "en": "the broad heart that embraces all;{end}"},
{"id": "C1716C", "jp": "人を思いやる心。{end}", "en": "the heart that cares for others--{end}"},
{"id": "C17178", "jp": "これに気付いてくれれば{end}", "en": "if you come to realize these,{end}"},
{"id": "C17186", "jp": "恐らく次の聖魔戦争は{end}", "en": "then the next Holy-Demon War{end}"},
{"id": "C17197", "jp": "起こらないだろう。{end}", "en": "will most likely never come.{end}"},
{"id": "C171A2", "jp": " {end}", "en": ""},
{"id": "C171A4", "jp": "そう、本当の聖魔戦争は今、{end}", "en": "Yes, the true Holy-Demon War has{end}"},
{"id": "C171B9", "jp": "始まったばかりなのである。{end}", "en": "only now just begun.{end}"},
{"id": "C171C8", "jp": "君たちの心の中の聖魔戦争が…。{end}", "en": "The Holy-Demon War in your own hearts...{end}"},
