{"id": "C1720A", "jp": "闇側の力の前に完膚無きまで{end}", "en": "Before the might of the Dark, we were{end}"},
{"id": "C1721F", "jp": "たたきのめされてしまった。{end}", "en": "utterly and completely crushed.{end}"},
{"id": "C1722D", "jp": "闇側の力が{end}", "en": "The Dark side's power...{end}"},
{"id": "C17236", "jp": "ここまで強大だとは思わなかった。{end}", "en": "I never dreamed it was this great.{end}"},
