{"id": "C17250", "jp": "ガイアスが近づいてくる{end}", "en": "Gaius draws near.{end}"},
{"id": "C1725D", "jp": "「安心しろ、光を滅ぼす気はない」{end}", "en": "\"Rest easy. I won't destroy the Light.\"{end}"},
{"id": "C17273", "jp": "「・・・・・・?」{end}", "en": "\"......?\"{end}"},
{"id": "C1727D", "jp": "「おまえとは、こんな形で{end}", "en": "\"I didn't want to meet you{end}"},
{"id": "C1728B", "jp": " 会いたくはなかった…{end}", "en": " like this...{end}"},
{"id": "C17298", "jp": " 人間の行く末は俺たちにまかせろ」{end}", "en": " Leave humanity's future to us.\"{end}"},
{"id": "C172AF", "jp": " {end}", "en": ""},
{"id": "C172B1", "jp": " {end}", "en": ""},
{"id": "C172B3", "jp": " {end}", "en": ""},
{"id": "C172B5", "jp": "しばらくして…{end}", "en": "After a while...{end}"},
{"id": "C172BD", "jp": "闇側の気配が消える。{end}", "en": "the Dark's presence fades away.{end}"},
{"id": "C172CD", "jp": " {end}", "en": ""},
{"id": "C172CF", "jp": " {end}", "en": ""},
{"id": "C172D1", "jp": " {end}", "en": ""},
{"id": "C172D3", "jp": "薄れゆく意識の中目の前に{end}", "en": "As my mind fades, before my eyes{end}"},
{"id": "C172E6", "jp": "異形の怪物が舞い降りてくる…{end}", "en": "a monstrous creature descends...{end}"},
{"id": "C172FB", "jp": "じっとこちらを見ている、{end}", "en": "It stares fixedly at me,{end}"},
{"id": "C17309", "jp": "何かを吟味しているように。{end}", "en": "as if weighing something up.{end}"},
{"id": "C1731A", "jp": "「…これが伝説の獣か」{end}", "en": "\"...So this is the Legendary Beast.\"{end}"},
{"id": "C17329", "jp": "すぐに光を滅しに来たんだとわかる。{end}", "en": "It's come to wipe out the Light, I know.{end}"},
{"id": "C1733E", "jp": "「そうか、{end}", "en": "\"I see...{end}"},
{"id": "C17344", "jp": " ガイアスも失敗したのか…」{end}", "en": " so Gaius failed too...\"{end}"},
{"id": "C17355", "jp": " {end}", "en": ""},
