{"id": "C17387", "jp": " {end}", "en": ""},
{"id": "C17389", "jp": " {end}", "en": ""},
{"id": "C1738C", "jp": "「よくぞ決心しました…光の王よ、{end}", "en": "\"You chose well... O King of Light.{end}"},
{"id": "C173A1", "jp": " これで我が光の勝利です。{end}", "en": " With this, our Light has won.{end}"},
{"id": "C173B3", "jp": " さあ、闇のものを滅っしましょう。{end}", "en": " Now, let us destroy the Dark ones.{end}"},
{"id": "C173C7", "jp": " これで完全な勝利になります。{end}", "en": " Then our victory will be complete.{end}"},
{"id": "C173DB", "jp": " {end}", "en": ""},
{"id": "C173DD", "jp": " フッ…{end}", "en": " Heh...{end}"},
{"id": "C173E2", "jp": " フフフ…{end}", "en": " Heh heh heh...{end}"},
{"id": "C173E8", "jp": " ハッハッハッハーッ!!{end}", "en": " Ha ha ha ha ha!!{end}"},
{"id": "C173F5", "jp": " さあ、{end}", "en": " Now,{end}"},
{"id": "C173FA", "jp": " 早く伝説の獣に命令しなさい!」{end}", "en": " quickly, command the Legendary Beast!\"{end}"},
{"id": "C17411", "jp": " {end}", "en": ""},
{"id": "C17413", "jp": " {end}", "en": ""},
{"id": "C17415", "jp": " {end}", "en": ""},
{"id": "C17417", "jp": "喜びに満ちた光の女神の、{end}", "en": "The Goddess of Light's joyful--{end}"},
{"id": "C17429", "jp": "いや、喜びというより{end}", "en": "no, less joyful than{end}"},
{"id": "C17435", "jp": "ほとんど狂喜に近い{end}", "en": "nearly mad with glee--{end}"},
{"id": "C17442", "jp": "うわずった声が響きわたる…{end}", "en": "shrill voice rings out...{end}"},
{"id": "C17452", "jp": "「さあ、何をためらうのです…{end}", "en": "\"Come, why do you hesitate...{end}"},
{"id": "C17462", "jp": " はやく!」{end}", "en": " Hurry!\"{end}"},
{"id": "C17469", "jp": "再び同じ声。逆らうことができない。{end}", "en": "The same voice again. I cannot defy it.{end}"},
