{"id": "C17481", "jp": " {end}", "en": ""},
{"id": "C17483", "jp": " {end}", "en": ""},
{"id": "C17485", "jp": "伝説の獣は{end}", "en": "The Legendary Beast,{end}"},
{"id": "C1748E", "jp": "今までの戦闘がなかったかのように{end}", "en": "as though no battle had ever been,{end}"},
{"id": "C174A2", "jp": "ぴくりとも動かない。{end}", "en": "doesn't so much as twitch.{end}"},
{"id": "C174AE", "jp": " {end}", "en": ""},
{"id": "C174B0", "jp": " {end}", "en": ""},
{"id": "C174B2", "jp": " {end}", "en": ""},
{"id": "C174B4", "jp": "静かに命令を待っている…{end}", "en": "It waits quietly for its orders...{end}"},
{"id": "C174C5", "jp": "とでもいうのだろうか。{end}", "en": "or so it would seem.{end}"},
{"id": "C174D1", "jp": "ふるえる手で、静かに、{end}", "en": "With trembling hands, quietly,{end}"},
{"id": "C174DF", "jp": "ゆっくりと剣を天高く指し示す。{end}", "en": "slowly I point my sword to the heavens.{end}"},
{"id": "C174F4", "jp": " {end}", "en": ""},
{"id": "C174F6", "jp": " {end}", "en": ""},
{"id": "C174F8", "jp": " {end}", "en": ""},
{"id": "C174FA", "jp": "すると今まで静かだった獣は{end}", "en": "Then the beast, silent until now,{end}"},
{"id": "C1750B", "jp": "1回2回と静かに力強く{end}", "en": "once, twice, quietly yet mightily,{end}"},
{"id": "C1751C", "jp": "羽ばたきを繰り返し{end}", "en": "beats its wings over and over,{end}"},
{"id": "C17529", "jp": "そして叫び声とも何とも言えない{end}", "en": "and giving a cry I can't even describe,{end}"},
{"id": "C1753D", "jp": "不気味な声を発し大地を蹴って{end}", "en": "an eerie sound, it kicks off the ground{end}"},
{"id": "C17554", "jp": "空へと飛び去っていった。{end}", "en": "and flies away into the sky.{end}"},
{"id": "C17564", "jp": "すぐに、その姿は小さな点となり、{end}", "en": "Soon its shape becomes a tiny dot,{end}"},
{"id": "C17578", "jp": "消えていく。{end}", "en": "and vanishes.{end}"},
