{"id": "C17647", "jp": " {end}", "en": ""},
{"id": "C17649", "jp": "地平線の向こうで{end}", "en": "Beyond the horizon,{end}"},
{"id": "C17656", "jp": "大きな火柱があがった。{end}", "en": "a great pillar of fire rises up,{end}"},
{"id": "C17665", "jp": "空を赤く焦がしている…{end}", "en": "scorching the sky red...{end}"},
{"id": "C17674", "jp": "きこえるはずのない悲鳴が、{end}", "en": "Screams I shouldn't be able to hear,{end}"},
{"id": "C17684", "jp": "つぶやきが、{end}", "en": "murmurs,{end}"},
{"id": "C1768B", "jp": "苦しみもだえる絶望の声が{end}", "en": "voices of despair writhing in agony--{end}"},
{"id": "C1769C", "jp": "確かに聞こえる。{end}", "en": "I hear them, without a doubt.{end}"},
{"id": "C176A7", "jp": " {end}", "en": ""},
{"id": "C176A9", "jp": " {end}", "en": ""},
{"id": "C176AB", "jp": " {end}", "en": ""},
{"id": "C176AD", "jp": "本当に良かったのだろうか?{end}", "en": "Was it truly for the best?{end}"},
{"id": "C176BE", "jp": "これで良かったのだろうか?{end}", "en": "Was this the right thing?{end}"},
{"id": "C176CD", "jp": "自分に問いかけてみる…{end}", "en": "I ask myself...{end}"},
{"id": "C176DC", "jp": "いやこれでいいんだ、いいはずだ、{end}", "en": "No, this is right. It has to be.{end}"},
{"id": "C176ED", "jp": "そうに決まっている。{end}", "en": "It must be.{end}"},
{"id": "C176F9", "jp": "次は負けない…?{end}", "en": "\"I won't lose next time\"...?{end}"},
{"id": "C17704", "jp": "次?{end}", "en": "Next time?{end}"},
{"id": "C17708", "jp": "またこんなことが繰り返されるのか?{end}", "en": "Is this going to happen all over again?{end}"},
{"id": "C1771C", "jp": "本当によかったのか?{end}", "en": "Was it really for the best?{end}"},
{"id": "C17729", "jp": " {end}", "en": ""},
{"id": "C1772B", "jp": " {end}", "en": ""},
{"id": "C1772D", "jp": " {end}", "en": ""},
{"id": "C1772F", "jp": "また一つさっきより{end}", "en": "Once more, bigger than the last,{end}"},
{"id": "C1773A", "jp": "ひときわ大きい炎が上がる…。{end}", "en": "another, fiercer blaze rises up...{end}"},
