{"id": "C17795", "jp": " {end}", "en": ""},
{"id": "C17798", "jp": "だめだ…勝てない…{end}", "en": "It's no use... I can't win...{end}"},
{"id": "C177A3", "jp": "こんなにも強力なものとは…{end}", "en": "I never knew it could be this strong...{end}"},
{"id": "C177B3", "jp": "もう力が入らない…{end}", "en": "I have no strength left...{end}"},
{"id": "C177BF", "jp": "みんな死んでしまったのだろうか?{end}", "en": "Has everyone died?{end}"},
{"id": "C177D1", "jp": "声が聞こえる…{end}", "en": "I hear voices...{end}"},
