{"id": "C177DF", "jp": " {end}", "en": ""},
{"id": "C177E1", "jp": "「申し訳ありません、至高神様…{end}", "en": "\"Forgive me, O Supreme God...{end}"},
{"id": "C177F7", "jp": " こんなことになろうとは」{end}", "en": " I did not foresee this outcome.\"{end}"},
{"id": "C17805", "jp": "「もうよい。まさか…{end}", "en": "\"Enough. I never thought...{end}"},
{"id": "C17810", "jp": " この神に逆らうとはおもわなんだ。{end}", "en": " that anyone would dare defy this god.{end}"},
{"id": "C17824", "jp": " しかし今回は規定通り{end}", "en": " But this time, by the rules,{end}"},
{"id": "C17835", "jp": " 光の勝利としよう。{end}", "en": " we shall call it a win for Light.{end}"},
{"id": "C17843", "jp": " 人間は光の法で治めることにする。{end}", "en": " Humanity shall obey the Law of Light.{end}"},
{"id": "C1785A", "jp": " 次回はこんな失態は許されないぞ」{end}", "en": " I'll not forgive such failure again.\"{end}"},
{"id": "C17871", "jp": "「はっ、心得てございます」{end}", "en": "\"Yes, I understand fully.\"{end}"},
{"id": "C17881", "jp": "「…次は、次は我が闇がご期待に{end}", "en": "\"...Next time, next time my Dark shall{end}"},
{"id": "C17897", "jp": " 添えることかと…」{end}", "en": " live up to your hopes...\"{end}"},
{"id": "C178A3", "jp": "「何をいうか!{end}", "en": "\"What are you saying!{end}"},
{"id": "C178AC", "jp": " 次も光が勝つに決まっておろう!」{end}", "en": " Light will surely win next time too!\"{end}"},
{"id": "C178C2", "jp": "「今回は今回、{end}", "en": "\"That was this time.{end}"},
{"id": "C178CE", "jp": " 偶然勝ったからって偉そうな…」{end}", "en": " A lucky win, and you act so high...\"{end}"},
{"id": "C178E3", "jp": "「何をこの負け犬の…」{end}", "en": "\"Why, you miserable loser...\"{end}"},
{"id": "C178F2", "jp": "「ひかえろ!!{end}", "en": "\"Silence!!{end}"},
{"id": "C178FA", "jp": " ワシを怒らせる気か!{end}", "en": " Do you wish to anger me!?{end}"},
{"id": "C17908", "jp": " 二人とも次に備えるがよい!」{end}", "en": " Both of you, prepare for next time!\"{end}"},
{"id": "C1791C", "jp": "「申し訳ありません…」{end}", "en": "\"We beg your pardon...\"{end}"},
{"id": "C1792A", "jp": " {end}", "en": ""},
{"id": "C1792C", "jp": " {end}", "en": ""},
{"id": "C1792E", "jp": " {end}", "en": ""},
{"id": "C17930", "jp": "薄れゆく意識の中で{end}", "en": "As my consciousness fades,{end}"},
{"id": "C1793E", "jp": "ハッキリと声が聞こえる…{end}", "en": "I hear the voices clearly...{end}"},
{"id": "C1794D", "jp": " {end}", "en": ""},
{"id": "C1794F", "jp": " {end}", "en": ""},
{"id": "C17951", "jp": " {end}", "en": ""},
{"id": "C17953", "jp": "この戦いは間違っている、{end}", "en": "This battle is wrong,{end}"},
{"id": "C17963", "jp": "絶対間違っている。{end}", "en": "absolutely wrong.{end}"},
{"id": "C17971", "jp": "光の法?そんなものは{end}", "en": "The Law of Light? Humans have{end}"},
{"id": "C1797E", "jp": "人間には必要はない。{end}", "en": "no need of such a thing.{end}"},
{"id": "C1798D", "jp": "人間は人間の法で生きて行くべきだ。{end}", "en": "Humans should live by human law.{end}"},
{"id": "C179A6", "jp": "こんな神のゲーム…{end}", "en": "This game of the gods...{end}"},
{"id": "C179B1", "jp": "だから天使も、龍もタイタンも{end}", "en": "That's why the angels, dragons, Titans{end}"},
{"id": "C179C3", "jp": "エルフもみな後悔をしているのだろう{end}", "en": "and elves must all be full of regret,{end}"},
{"id": "C179D7", "jp": "聖魔戦争の本当の意味を{end}", "en": "for the Holy-Demon War's true meaning{end}"},
{"id": "C179EB", "jp": "知ってしまったから。{end}", "en": "is something they have come to know.{end}"},
{"id": "C179F7", "jp": " {end}", "en": ""},
{"id": "C179F9", "jp": " {end}", "en": ""},
{"id": "C179FB", "jp": " {end}", "en": ""},
{"id": "C179FD", "jp": "今までその場にいた{end}", "en": "Having stood there until now,{end}"},
{"id": "C17A09", "jp": "伝説の獣が空に飛び立つ…{end}", "en": "the Legendary Beast takes to the sky...{end}"},
{"id": "C17A1C", "jp": " {end}", "en": ""},
{"id": "C17A1E", "jp": " {end}", "en": ""},
{"id": "C17A20", "jp": " {end}", "en": ""},
{"id": "C17A22", "jp": "「闇は滅すが、よいな」{end}", "en": "\"The Dark shall be destroyed. Agreed?\"{end}"},
{"id": "C17A30", "jp": "「仰せのままに…」{end}", "en": "\"As you command...\"{end}"},
{"id": "C17A3B", "jp": " {end}", "en": ""},
{"id": "C17A3D", "jp": " {end}", "en": ""},
{"id": "C17A3F", "jp": " {end}", "en": ""},
{"id": "C17A41", "jp": "しばらくして、{end}", "en": "After a while,{end}"},
{"id": "C17A49", "jp": "地平線のむこうで炎が上がる…{end}", "en": "flames rise beyond the horizon...{end}"},
{"id": "C17A5D", "jp": "闇の都市が獣によって{end}", "en": "Even now, the beast is wiping out{end}"},
{"id": "C17A6C", "jp": "今消えようとしている。{end}", "en": "the cities of the Dark.{end}"},
