{"id": "C17AA5", "jp": "闇側の力の前に完膚無きまで{end}", "en": "Before the might of the Dark, we were{end}"},
{"id": "C17ABA", "jp": "たたきのめされてしまった。{end}", "en": "utterly and completely crushed.{end}"},
{"id": "C17AC8", "jp": "闇側の力が{end}", "en": "The Dark side's power...{end}"},
{"id": "C17AD1", "jp": "ここまで強大だとは思わなかった。{end}", "en": "I never dreamed it was this great.{end}"},
{"id": "C17AE5", "jp": " {end}", "en": ""},
{"id": "C17AE7", "jp": " {end}", "en": ""},
{"id": "C17AE9", "jp": " {end}", "en": ""},
{"id": "C17AEB", "jp": "「闇よ!我が闇よ…ついにこのときが」{end}", "en": "\"O Dark, my Dark... at last, the hour!\"{end}"},
{"id": "C17B01", "jp": "バルナイオスのうわずった声が響きわたる。{end}", "en": "Barnaios's shrill voice rings out.{end}"},
{"id": "C17B18", "jp": "ああ、みんなは大丈夫なんだろうか?{end}", "en": "Oh, I wonder if everyone is all right.{end}"},
{"id": "C17B2D", "jp": "みんな何とかがんばってくれ…{end}", "en": "Everyone, please, hold on somehow...{end}"},
{"id": "C17B3D", "jp": " {end}", "en": ""},
{"id": "C17B3F", "jp": " {end}", "en": ""},
{"id": "C17B41", "jp": " {end}", "en": ""},
{"id": "C17B43", "jp": "どれくらい時が流れたのだろう…{end}", "en": "How much time has passed...{end}"},
{"id": "C17B55", "jp": "薄れゆく意識の中目の前に{end}", "en": "As my mind fades, before my eyes{end}"},
{"id": "C17B68", "jp": "異形の怪物が舞い降りてくる…{end}", "en": "a monstrous creature descends...{end}"},
{"id": "C17B7D", "jp": "じっとこちらを見ている、{end}", "en": "It stares fixedly at me,{end}"},
{"id": "C17B8B", "jp": "何かを吟味しているように。{end}", "en": "as if weighing something up.{end}"},
{"id": "C17B9C", "jp": "「…これが伝説の獣か」{end}", "en": "\"...So this is the Legendary Beast.\"{end}"},
{"id": "C17BAB", "jp": "かすかに抱いていた希望が、{end}", "en": "The faint hope I had held on to{end}"},
{"id": "C17BBC", "jp": "絶望へと変わる。{end}", "en": "turns into despair.{end}"},
{"id": "C17BC8", "jp": "みんな…{end}", "en": "Everyone...{end}"},
{"id": "C17BCD", "jp": "獣の狂った叫び声があたりを包み込む…{end}", "en": "The beast's mad scream fills the air...{end}"},
